  "content": "<div class=\"p-8 font-serif max-w-lg mx-auto bg-gradient-to-b from-rose-50 to-white text-rose-950 rounded-2xl border-2 border-rose-200 relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n  <div class=\"absolute -top-6 -left-6 text-3xl opacity-30\">🌸</div>\n  <div class=\"absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 text-3xl opacity-30\">🌸</div>\n  \n  <div class=\"text-center relative z-10 space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"text-4xl\">👑✨🏰</div>\n    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-rose-500 uppercase\">Decreto Real de Celebração</p>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-rose-800 tracking-tight\">\n      O Baile de Aniversário\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-rose-900 leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto\">\n      O Reino de Documestre anuncia com imensa alegria o aniversário da Princesa <strong class=\"text-rose-600 text-base font-bold\">{{nome_princesa}}</strong> que celebrará seus <strong class=\"text-rose-600\">{{idade_completada}} anos</strong> com um grande baile!\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"my-6 border-y-2 border-rose-200/50 py-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center\">\n      <div class=\"bg-rose-100/30 p-2.5 rounded-lg\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-rose-500 uppercase\">Dia Real</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-base text-rose-900 font-bold\">{{data_evento}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-rose-100/30 p-2.5 rounded-lg\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-rose-500 uppercase\">Horário do Baile</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-base text-rose-900 font-bold\">{{horario_evento}}</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-rose-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-rose-100 text-center\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-rose-500 uppercase mb-1\">Localização do Castelo</span>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-900 font-medium font-sans\">{{salao_reino}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-4 text-center font-sans\">\n      <p class=\"text-[10px] text-rose-400 uppercase font-mono mb-2\">Mande um mensageiro para confirmar sua carruagem</p>\n      <span class=\"inline-block bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-2.5 px-6 rounded-full shadow-md transition cursor-pointer\">\n        Confirmar Carruagem: {{contato_real}} 💖\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
